window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The galaxy's most dangerous warriors are about to meet their match.</b></p> <p><i>Pursued (Book 4):</i> As the empire's deadliest assassin, she's never failed a mission. But infiltrating a raider horde to seduce and kill the notorious Raas Bron? That's before she meets the formidable Vandar warlord whose dark eyes and fierce intelligence ignite something she thought was long dead. Now she doesn't know if she's hunting him—or if he's hunting her.</p> <p><i>Punished (Book 5):</i> When the empire threatens her planet, she turns to the one being who can teach her to fight—an exiled Vandar warrior who wants nothing to do with humans. Corvak is violent, brooding, and dangerous, but he's her only hope. His training comes with a price: help him escape the planet she's desperate to save. But can she let him go when their battles awaken desires neither expected?</p> <p><i>Provoked (Book 6):</i> She meant to stow away to her sister's ship. Instead, she's trapped aboard the warbird of the most feared Vandar of all—the Lunari Raas, the deranged warlord who never sleeps. He makes her a deal: stay until the moons align, and he'll return her home. But his tortured soul and burning touch provoke feelings that make her question if she'll want to leave at all.<br> <br> This collection of three full-length sci-fi romance novels delivers explosive HEAs with no cheating. Packed with steamy scenes aboard alien warships, epic space battles, and scorching enemies-to-lovers heat that will leave you breathless.</p> <p>If you crave dominant alien warriors, pulse-pounding action, and heroines who fight for what they want, you'll devour this collection of books 4-6 in Tana Stone's bestselling Raider Warlords of the Vandar series.</p>"; 
